('mit','65.23.06','Impact on the environment','"AI, and large generative models in particular, might produce increased carbon emissions and increase water usage for their training and operation."','Moderate','Likely',ARRAY['6. Socioeconomic and Environmental','6.6 > Environmental harm']::text[],'IBM2025 - AI Risk Atlas '),
